er-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "cc30d3d1-1efe-582e-944c-8f9d386f5738" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461199} {:answer/id #uuid "2dd1d8db-a0f8-5a3f-9666-d01d5c0ea372" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461200}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "cc30d3d1-1efe-582e-944c-8f9d386f5738" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461199} :answer-field/id #uuid "e9afc227-2585-54bd-9518-4d409658168b" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186462353}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "efd9ac2b-7a32-57f6-9899-3da1aeffaa13" :question/math-academy-id "q-102666" :question/problem "Consider the matrices\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 2\\end{bmatrix},\\,B=\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{2}{3} & -\\frac{1}{3} \\\\ \\frac{1}{3} & \\frac{1}{3}\\end{bmatrix},\\,C=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nI. $AB=BA={I}_{2}$\n\nII. $AC=CA={I}_{2}$\n\nIII. $C={A}^{-1}$\n\nSelect all that apply. If none apply, leave all boxes unchecked." :question/worked-solution "- First, we check whether $AB=BA={I}_{2}.$ Computing $AB$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AB & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{2}{3} & -\\frac{1}{3} \\\\ \\frac{1}{3} & \\frac{1}{3}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & ={I}_{2}.\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLikewise, computing $BA$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}BA & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{2}{3} & -\\frac{1}{3} \\\\ \\frac{1}{3} & \\frac{1}{3}\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & ={I}_{2}.\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, statement I is true.\n\n- Now, we check whether $AC=CA={I}_{2}.$ Computing $AC$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AC & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}3 & ∗ \\\\ ∗ & ∗\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & \\ne {I}_{2}.\\,\\times \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, statement II is false. As a result, $C\\ne {A}^{-1}$ and statement III is false too.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I only\"."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186237919 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "b3743095-b86d-5690-811f-9531139d1e99" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461201} {:answer/id #uuid "0ac7323d-37e2-59e4-a0ab-792785d6d9f1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461202}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "b3743095-b86d-5690-811f-9531139d1e99" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461201} :answer-field/id #uuid "4e0d85d4-3c22-5afa-997d-194a34f411f9" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186462354} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1380862d-ca0a-5272-9181-d311561d8806" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461203} {:answer/id #uuid "5e3e85aa-6154-5b67-b61a-417273e8e291" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461204}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "5e3e85aa-6154-5b67-b61a-417273e8e291" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461204} :answer-field/id #uuid "4887cf56-6456-5833-b629-a8cf9dec498f" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186462355} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "8048f25f-64aa-5f39-88e5-04a81280042c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461205} {:answer/id #uuid "49ca8a54-1d01-5b3f-b737-4ae82e38a518" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461206}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "8048f25f-64aa-5f39-88e5-04a81280042c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461205} :answer-field/id #uuid "6f5cd5df-6278-5c4d-b889-1bdbfb2580bd" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186462356}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "c35a4d59-f293-5742-bd9e-003fa5d50c23" :question/math-academy-id "q-102669" :question/problem "Consider the matrices\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 0\\end{bmatrix},\\,B=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 3\\end{bmatrix},\\,C=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 3\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n- **I.** $AB=BA={I}_{2}$\n- **II.** $AC=CA={I}_{2}$\n- **III.** $B={A}^{-1}$\n\nSelect all that apply. If none apply, leave all boxes unchecked." :question/worked-solution "- First, we check whether $AB=BA={I}_{2}.$ Computing $AB$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AB & =\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}∗ & 6 \\\\ ∗ & ∗\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & \\ne {I}_{2}.\\,\\times \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, statement I is false. As a result, $B\\ne {A}^{-1}$ and statement III is false too.\n\n- Now, we check whether $AC=CA={I}_{2}.$ Computing $AC$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AC & =\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}0 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & ={I}_{2}.\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLikewise, computing $CA$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}CA & =\\begin{bmatrix}0 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 3\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & ={I}_{2}.\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, statement II is true.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II only\"."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186237920 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "eccb9532-7de2-59e7-a82e-6ab5c5c256d4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461207} {:answer/id #uuid "a25d5fdd-a31e-51b5-a9cb-b9b85d9e48e5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461208}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a25d5fdd-a31e-51b5-a9cb-b9b85d9e48e5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461208} :answer-field/id #uuid "3a04379d-5378-57ac-8c8a-5c79d6defc9c" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186462357} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2a26ee96-ebd3-5ef0-a937-f4248c9f7f8d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461209} {:answer/id #uuid "7a779c6b-ec23-5c8c-8565-47792308afae" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461210}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "2a26ee96-ebd3-5ef0-a937-f4248c9f7f8d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461209} :answer-field/id #uuid "0a3a0ee6-e7ec-58ca-a7bd-fe2195a3acfc" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186462358} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "aeb9f5d1-a68b-53b2-8b45-266c26e51dcc" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461211} {:answer/id #uuid "c61e9668-9427-5911-9597-cfb248789995" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461212}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c61e9668-9427-5911-9597-cfb248789995" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461212} :answer-field/id #uuid "9af69d4d-34e6-541a-a6e6-dbacb78cccfe" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186462359}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "67a1c719-c84d-5d17-9d41-c30fb7529952" :question/math-academy-id "q-102670" :question/problem "Consider the matrices\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 2 \\\\ 2 & -2\\end{bmatrix},\\,B=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -1 \\\\ -1 & -\\frac{3}{2}\\end{bmatrix},\\,C=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -1 \\\\ -1 & -3\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n- **I.** $AB=BA={I}_{2}$\n- **II.** $AC=CA={I}_{2}$\n- **III.** $C\\ne {A}^{-1}$\n\nSelect all that apply. If none apply, leave all boxes unchecked." :question/worked-solution "- First, we check whether $AB=BA={I}_{2}.$ Computing $AB$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AB & =\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 2 \\\\ 2 & -2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -1 \\\\ -1 & -\\frac{3}{2}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & ={I}_{2}.\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLikewise, computing $BA$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}BA & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -1 \\\\ -1 & -\\frac{3}{2}\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 2 \\\\ 2 & -2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & ={I}_{2}.\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, statement I is true.\n\n- Now, we check whether $AC=CA={I}_{2}.$ Computing $AC$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AC & =\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 2 \\\\ 2 & -2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -1 \\\\ -1 & -3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}∗ & -3 \\\\ ∗ & ∗\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & \\ne {I}_{2}.\\,\\times \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, statement II is false. As a result, $C\\ne {A}^{-1}$ and statement III is true.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I and III only\"."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186237921 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "caf47f24-5826-503b-9314-2ce4fcb361ad" :ans