st, we check whether $AB=BA={I}_{2}.$ Computing $AB$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AB & =\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 4 \\\\ 0 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -2 \\\\ 0 & -1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 & ∗ \\\\ ∗ & ∗\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & \\ne {I}_{2}.\\,\\times \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, statement I is false. As a result, $B\\ne {A}^{-1}$ and statement III is true.\n\n- Now, we check whether $AC=CA={I}_{2}.$ Computing $AC$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AC & =\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 4 \\\\ 0 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-\\frac{1}{2} & -2 \\\\ 0 & -1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & ={I}_{2}.\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLikewise, computing $CA$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}CA & =\\begin{bmatrix}-\\frac{1}{2} & -2 \\\\ 0 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 4 \\\\ 0 & -1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & ={I}_{2}.\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, statement II is true.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II and III only\"."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186253258 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e4efcf39-ef5c-51be-9197-fd336dcc21cc" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186448054} {:answer/id #uuid "46eb2630-2587-530d-ae7f-6568bb2b9247" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186448055}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "46eb2630-2587-530d-ae7f-6568bb2b9247" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186448055} :answer-field/id #uuid "66536e33-097f-5b8e-aabe-387b94e6dcdf" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449067} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "dd936360-4ab5-54cc-85f8-f730e2f97b11" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186448056} {:answer/id #uuid "59684c94-4157-5480-bbf9-