 $DC$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}DC & =\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 1 \\\\ 1 & -2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & ={I}_{2}.\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, statement I is true. As a result, $D={C}^{-1}$ and statement III is true too.\n\n- Now, we check whether $DE=ED={I}_{2}.$ Computing $DE$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}DE & =\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 1 \\\\ 1 & -2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}∗ & ∗ \\\\ -2 & ∗\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & \\ne {I}_{2}.\\,\\times \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, statement II is false.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I and III only\"."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186338995 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "63c25817-90d5-5739-bde8-c7bb037f4127" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186451537} {:answer/id #uuid "ce945b72-5264-5a5b-8a2f-5f3cc5335b1c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186451538}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "63c25817-90d5-5739-bde8-c7bb037f4127" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186451537} :answer-field/id #uuid "75de82e6-fb57-5a51-a8f9-1335844b81db" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186452616} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2aeacf71-84c6-5a17-9d5e-1859dec82bf3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186451539} {:answer/id #uuid "1fb17603-bcaf-5635-9adf-ab7d73d0ab98" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186451540}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "1fb17603-bcaf-5635-9adf-ab7d73d0ab98" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186451540} :answer-field/id #uuid "652e549d-bd49-5b19-8c97-3