gned}\n$$\n\nLikewise, computing $DB$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}DB & =\\begin{bmatrix}0 & \\frac{1}{2} \\\\ -\\frac{1}{2} & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}0 & -2 \\\\ 2 & 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & ={I}_{2}.\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, statement II is true. As a result, $D={B}^{-1}$ and statement III is true too.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II and III only\"."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186338996 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3eaec500-2809-5bb5-861d-56d1da22f167" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186451543} {:answer/id #uuid "6ebf9533-e707-5bf6-8742-eb76ec6be172" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186451544}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "6ebf9533-e707-5bf6-8742-eb76ec6be172" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186451544} :answer-field/id #uuid "f29819b3-4f4a-51ee-bbae-9782ec90563c" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186452619} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "cd03c76f-01ad-5869-9266-ea6396baa60f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186451545} {:answer/id #uuid "0249768e-eeb3-505e-bc4e-f893b8cbb258" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186451546}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "cd03c76f-01ad-5869-9266-ea6396baa60f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186451545} :answer-field/id #uuid "938a501e-fad4-53b6-847b-60d0820298e9" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186452620} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2ba7af21-5652-57ba-8798-d37c8fda3fe8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false