  & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 & ∗ \\\\ ∗ & ∗\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & \\ne {I}_{2}.\\,\\times \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, statement II is false. As a result, $G\\ne {E}^{-1}$ and statement III is false too.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I only\"."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186557709 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "bf82865b-b7f8-5978-a65d-6ceaeecc7985" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557768} {:answer/id #uuid "d2c67902-8586-522d-8128-26d6372edb3c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557777}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "d2c67902-8586-522d-8128-26d6372edb3c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557777} :answer-field/id #uuid "352475c6-893f-5d15-8bd4-4fc7d65c9b40" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557713} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e8f869e2-c759-591a-9c02-906bc98f760f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557789} {:answer/id #uuid "e9e346c7-807b-58b0-9826-de71aa5abe49" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557791}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e9e346c7-807b-58b0-9826-de71aa5abe49" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557791} :answer-field/id #uuid "5aac40eb-e4b1-5a40-92f2-d09ca0cd77c3" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557725} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "023a940e-0586-53bb-85a2-7d425b0cf6a9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557703} {:answer/id #uuid "ae4cf946-1ca5-5f24-9b50-8c5503ce3a04" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557758}] 