ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557784}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "933e41fa-bbab-5d05-965d-5162035714bc" :question/problem "Consider the matrices\n\n$$\nE=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & -2 \\\\ 3 & 1\\end{bmatrix},\\,F=\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{1}{4} & \\frac{1}{2} \\\\ -\\frac{3}{4} & -\\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix},\\,G=\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{1}{4} & \\frac{1}{2} \\\\ \\frac{3}{4} & -\\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $EF=FE={I}_{2}$\n- **II.** $EG=GE={I}_{2}$\n- **III.** $G={E}^{-1}$" :question/worked-solution "- First, we check whether $EF=FE={I}_{2}.$ Computing $EF$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}EF & =\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & -2 \\\\ 3 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{1}{4} & \\frac{1}{2} \\\\ -\\frac{3}{4} & -\\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & ={I}_{2}.\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLikewise, computing $FE$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}FE & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{1}{4} & \\frac{1}{2} \\\\ -\\frac{3}{4} & -\\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & -2 \\\\ 3 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & ={I}_{2}.\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, statement I is true.\n\n- Now, we check whether $EG=GE={I}_{2}.$ Computing $EG$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}EG & =\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & -2 \\\\ 3 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{1}{4} & \\frac{1}{2} \\\\ \\frac{3}{4} & -\\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}∗ & ∗ \\\\ \\frac{3}{2} & ∗\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & \\ne {I}_{2}.\\,\\times \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, statement II is false. As a result, $G\\ne {E}^{-1}$ and statement III is false too.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I only\"."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186557746 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "35a0f523-b1e4-57b4-8986-3d408f116ada" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557715} {:answer/id #uuid "4f30ad3a-ebca-54d0-80d8-eb5e24d49530" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557720}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "4f30ad3a-ebca-54d0-80d8-eb5e24d49530" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557720} :answer-field/id #uuid "8f860d9c-0f4b-51cc-941b-fa8e0bb36f8f" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557743} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "539f2745-380c-5c87-9c4b-698d2d8a5ae1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557722} {:answer/id #uuid "e59853dc-024a-5613-8bda-a7a5ad6a4077" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557787}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e59853dc-024a-5613-8bda-a7a5ad6a4077" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557787} :answer-field/id #uuid "d9e9e3af-3b8c-5fe9-9bf6-926f2aefd6ba" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557781} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1373a24c-5358-54bd-954f-2cee9ede5935" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557705} {:answer/id #uuid "d2d87237-4b30-5309-9ba1-cf6d51133951" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557778}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "d2d87237-4b30-5309-9ba1-cf6d51133951" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557778} :answer-field/id #uuid "e71d7935-1ded-546e-be49-1b0bba791d94" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557788}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "944df8b7-b85c-56ef-a0a1-42de38bae564" :question/problem "Consider the matrices\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{1}{3} & \\frac{2}{3} \\\\ 1 & -\\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix},\\,B=\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{3}{5} & \\frac{4}{5} \\\\ \\frac{6}{5} & -\\frac{2}{5}\\end{bmatrix},\\,C=\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{3}{5} & \\frac{6}{5} \\\\ \\frac{4}{5} & -\\frac{2}{5}\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n- **I.** $AB=BA={I}_{2}$\n- **II.** $AC=CA={I}_{2}$\n- **III.** $C\\ne {A}^{-1}$\n\nSelect all that apply. If none apply, leave all boxes unchecked." :question/worked-solution "- First, we check whether $AB=BA={I}_{2}.$ Computing $AB$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AB & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{1}{3} & \\frac{2}{3} \\\\ 1 & -\\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{3}{5} & \\frac{4}{5} \\\\ \\frac{6}{5} & -\\frac{2}{5}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & ={I}_{2}.\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLikewise, computing $BA$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}BA & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{3}{5} & \\frac{4}{5} \\\\ \\frac{6}{5} & -\\frac{2}{5}\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{1}{3} & \\frac{2}{3} \\\\ 1 & -\\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & ={I}_{2}.\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, statement I is true.\n\n- Now, we check whether $AC=CA={I}_{2}.$ Computing $AC$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AC & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{1}{3} & \\frac{2}{3} \\\\ 1 & -\\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{3}{5} & \\frac{6}{5} \\\\ \\frac{4}{5} & -\\frac{2}{5}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}∗ & \\frac{2}{15} \\\\ ∗ & ∗\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & \\ne {I}_{2}.\\,\\times \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, statement II is false. As a result, $C\\ne {A}^{-1}$ and statement III is true.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I and III only\"."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186557767 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "696039bf-4b19-5cb1-b178-6b29548d1105" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557730} {:answer/id #uuid "eabda44b-f9a8-5f27-b2fa-00740c2ab541" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557793}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "696039bf-4b19-5cb1-b178-6b29548d1105" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557730} :answer-field/id #uuid "00fcb256-4dfb-5083-89d1-c76082b6d89b" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557700} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5336188a-41c0-5ee3-b5ff-b215f42ed5a3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557721} {:answer/id #uuid "99f095f1-43c3-57d7-b82b-34e083cf0de1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557748}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "99f095f1-43c3-57d7-b82b-34e083cf0de1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557748} :answer-field/id #uuid "99d4eefb-99fe-57f0-b1dd-b1f21dc966d7" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557747} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1fac1f39-7be8-5bdd-8437-10ddf03fd830" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557711} {:answer/id #uuid "cadbd61f-38c2-5075-adb8-c50598a25814" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557775}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "1fac1f39-7be8-5bdd-8437-10ddf03fd830" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557711} :answer-field/id #uuid "c6950a7a-77e0-5196-930a-37b6e5fb6219" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557773}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "bf7c0c14-0345-5afe-989a-5e55f8a33abc" :question/problem "Consider the matrices\n\n$$\nC=\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{1}{2} & -\\frac{2}{3} \\\\ -\\frac{3}{2} & 1\\end{bmatrix},\\,D=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & -\\frac{4}{3} \\\\ -3 & -1\\end{bmatrix},\\,E=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & \\frac{2}{3} \\\\ \\frac{3}{2} & \\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $CD=DC={I}_{2}$\n\n- **II.** $DE=ED={I}_{2}$\n\n- **III.** $D={C}^{-1}$" :question/worked-solution "- First, we check whether $CD=DC={I}_{2}.$ Computing $CD$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}CD & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{1}{2} & -\\frac{2}{3} \\\\ -\\frac{3}{2} & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & -\\frac{4}{3} \\\\ -3 & -1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & ={I}_{2}.\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLikewise, computing $DC$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}DC & =\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & -\\frac{4}{3} \\\\ -3 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{1}{2} & -\\frac{2}{3} \\\\ -\\frac{3}{2} & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & ={I}_{2}.\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, statement I is true. As a result, $D={C}^{-1}$ and statement III is true too.\n\n- Now, we check whether $DE=ED={I}_{2}.$ Computing $DE$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}DE & =\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & -\\frac{4}{3} \\\\ -3 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & \\frac{2}{3} \\\\ \\frac{3}{2} & \\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-4 & ∗ \\\\ ∗ & ∗\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & \\ne {I}_{2}.\\,\\times \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, statement II is false.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I and III only\"."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186557776 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "18d2458d-fd3e-5dae-847c-b5a4feb35268" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557708} {:answer/id #uuid "4b99ab47-f438-51cf-94cf-68be9